                <pb facs="1075" n="925" sameAs="frus:frus1907p2/pg925"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 7370/2 a.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        Minister Peirce.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1907-12-20"><hi rendition="#italic">December 20,
                        1907</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Convey to Mrs. Hauge an expression of sincere sympathy and regret over the death
                    of her husband, whose loss we shall feel deeply in America.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Root.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
